      "Section": "RSC data quality requirements",
      "Anchor": "rsc-data-quality-requirements",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "As a LinkedIn partner, you must meet the data quality thresholds defined on this page before your Recruiter System Connect (RSC) integration is certified and made generally available (GA) to production customers. If any metric deviates from the expected threshold, you must analyze the examples with LinkedIn, resolve any data-sync issues, and provide a clear explanation for any unavoidable deviation.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Applicant evaluation",
      "Anchor": "applicant-evaluation",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Applicant evaluation"
      ],
      "Text": "These metrics ensure your data allows LinkedIn to map applications to jobs and candidates, determine application stage, and access resume or profile data for LinkedIn Hiring Assistant (LiHA) evaluation.",
